   "role": "customer",
   "text": "my oven fan keeps going after ive turned the oven off, been about 20 mins now. is it broken??"
  },
  {
   "role": "assistant",
   "text": "No, it is not broken. Most modern ovens have a cooling fan that continues to run for 10–30 minutes after you switch the oven off. Since it has been running for about 20 minutes, this fits perfectly with normal behaviour. It should stop automatically once the internal temperature drops sufficiently. If it continues running long after the oven has completely cooled down (e.g., an hour later), then there may be a fault with the fan motor or control board."
  }
